  "citation": "New J; Stubbings A; Li F; Bass B; Adams M; Berres A (2023): Model America - Arizona extract from ORNL's AutoBEM v1.1. Southwest Urban Corridor Integrated Field Laboratory (SW-IFL). Dataset. doi:10.15485/2212792",
