    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Building footprint and height data from Google was obtained for the state of Arizona.",
      "The building type, building standard, and missing heights were assigned statistically resulting in an input data set containing building ID, Centroid, Footprint2D, State_abbr, Area, Area2D, Height, NumFloors, WWR_surfaces, CZ, BuildingType, and Standard.",
      "This data was inputted into the AutoBEM workflow to generate the OSM and IDF files for every building in the state of Arizona."
